# Post-game score screen, pushed over the final game view: a 40% scrim, the statistics table in one panel (the unit
# cameos stay as column icons, winner marks at the row edge), the chat (or the war-school advice in solo) in a second
# panel, Save Replay / Buddies at the left of the bottom bar, Continue / Main Menu at the right. The header band is
# matched by its legacy rect before its parent moves; MainBackdrop and GadgetParent hold the controls and are made
# frame-sized. Units: 1 = frame height / 1080. Columns: player at 124 (240 wide), seven statistics from 380 at a pitch
# of 208.
hide at:37,68,768,125
hide $ParentScoreScreen
scrim
window $MainBackdrop left top 0 0 1920 1080
hide $MainBackdrop
window $GadgetParent left top 0 0 1920 1080
hide $GadgetParent
hide $Line

